      "source": [
        "# f-string\n",
        "\n",
        "An f-string is a formatted string literal prefixed with `f`, containing replacement fields evaluated at runtime. For example, `f\"Hello, {name}!\"` inserts `name`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-f-string)"
      ]
    }
  ],
